## AgentCloud desktop environment

Copy to `.env` in this directory (never commit).

```sh
cp .env.example .env
```

```
# Required for real assistant replies (D1.6).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional model override (default: gpt-4o-mini).
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# AgentCloud web origin used for Better Auth employee sign-in (HAC-24).
# Keep `just` / `just dev` running at this URL while using desktop auth.
AGENTCLOUD_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# Optional: set to 1 to open docked DevTools with the chat window.
# Leave unset for a single product window (default).
AGENTCLOUD_DESKTOP_DEVTOOLS=
```

Without `OPENAI_API_KEY`, the app still launches and persists chats; send shows a setup message instead of inventing a reply.

Employee sign-in uses the same Better Auth accounts as the web app. Session cookies are stored under Electron userData `auth/` (OS-encrypted when available) and never written into chat JSON.
